# Deeds pulled from Sheffield's public register are ~70MB of scanned images and
# are re-downloadable with scripts/scrape_sheffield_register.py, which records a
# sha256 and source URL for every file in the manifest. Keep the blobs out of git.
data/fixtures/pdfs/sheffield/*.pdf

# graphify: commit the graph deliverables (graph.json / report / HTML) for shared team
# context, but never the regenerable cache or machine-specific build state
docs/graphify-out/cache/
docs/graphify-out/.graphify_root
docs/graphify-out/.graphify_build.json
docs/graphify-out/.graphify_analysis.json
docs/graphify-out/manifest.json
/graphify-out/
